  m_text: '> STATUS: ACTIVE

    > ERA: THE CLASSIC ERA (1990s)

    > FIRST APPEARANCE: RESIDENT EVIL 1 (1996)

    > CURRENT AFFILIATION: B.S.A.A. / HOUND WOLF SQUAD


    [OPERATIONAL DATA LOG]

    An ex-Air Force pilot and founding veteran member of the Special Tactics and Rescue Service (S.T.A.R.S.) Alpha Team. He has dedicated his entire adult life to tracking down and eradicating the bio-organic legacy of the Umbrella Corporation across the globe.

'
